[MUST] DOTNET-INTERFACE-I-PREFIX (interface): Interfaces are PascalCase adjectives or noun phrases carrying a capital 'I' at the front, and a class implementing one is usually named identically minus that leading 'I' (an interface ISerializer typically has a concrete implementation simply called Serializer).
